Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.46,0:00:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.37,0:00:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.70,0:00:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is possible to have\Nman-made cursed corpses act
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.84,0:00:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more autonomously than\Nother forms of manipulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they're always powered by consuming\Ncursed energy from the sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.48,0:00:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, that thing is sustaining\Nitself on its own cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.72,0:00:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The higher-ups are currently trying\Nto designate you as a special
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,grade and officially sentence\Nyou to indefinite imprisonment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.56,0:00:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because if you can intentionally\Ncreate a thing like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then it stands to reason you\Ncould easily create your own army.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.78,0:00:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So tell me, Yaga, you truly have\Nno idea how that thing was created?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.84,0:00:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that your official stance?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.72,0:00:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.78,0:00:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Masamichi, everyone's worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.28,0:00:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They told me you seemed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.78,0:00:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.66,0:01:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I told them all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.74,0:01:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Masamichi is feeling down,\Nwe just have to cheer him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.18,0:01:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.26,0:01:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty smart, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.14,0:01:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.24,0:01:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Takeru, I'm sorry, but I have\Nto leave home for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.78,0:01:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you please let\Nthe others know for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.12,0:01:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leaving for work again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.08,0:01:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be a long trip, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.46,0:01:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.30,0:01:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This forest is still under the\Nconstant protection of Tengen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your mother will come soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll be glad to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.32,0:01:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be all right without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.58,0:01:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.08,0:01:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Masamichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.92,0:01:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure will be lonely\Naround here without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.24,0:01:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kusakabe, are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.10,0:01:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just don't go telling\Nanyone that I helped you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.16,0:02:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were captured to lure Yaga out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all you need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.04,0:02:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I owe that man\Na favor. Go on. Get.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.02,0:02:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.76,0:02:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing is not your nephew.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.36,0:02:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a vessel with\Nyour nephew's information.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.62,0:02:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to tell\Nme that I can't live
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.48,0:02:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the present if I stay\Nhung up on the dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.84,0:02:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,forever living in the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.40,0:02:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, my little sister can\Nno longer live in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.10,0:02:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She needs to live in the\Npresent, meaning with Takeru.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.18,0:02:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Masamichi, I think that\Nlady's my mother, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.28,0:02:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.44,0:02:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good job recognizing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.70,0:02:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I had a feeling that's who she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must be a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.10,0:03:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry but don't worry I get it you can't\Nlet anyone know that your fully autonomous
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.10,0:03:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cursed corpses exist so he can't live with
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.66,0:03:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her and I'm sorry why are you apologizing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.60,0:03:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.64,0:03:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean it. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.68,0:03:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Principal Yaga, where do you think\Nyou're going without any cursed corpses?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.98,0:03:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to see my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.02,0:03:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been sentenced to\Ndeath, so I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.92,0:03:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why not save your own life?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.16,0:03:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll let you live if\Nyou just tell them how you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.70,0:03:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,create those fully autonomous\Nman-made cursed corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.14,0:03:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all sure got suddenly brave\Nthe moment Satoru Gojo was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.36,0:04:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Principal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.96,0:04:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.64,0:04:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll handle the rest by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.82,0:04:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.78,0:04:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, you use the body's information\Nto reproduce the soul's information.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.22,0:04:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then the soul's information is placed\Ninside the cursed corpse's core.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.56,0:04:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to place cores\Nthat house three highly
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.28,0:04:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,compatible souls into\Na single cursed corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then force those souls to\Nobserve each other at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.98,0:04:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you do that step,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.76,0:05:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it finally allows the souls to stabilize,\Nso self-awareness can take root.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.82,0:05:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roughly three months after that's born,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.72,0:05:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it will begin supplying\Nits own cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.36,0:05:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why talk now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.20,0:05:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you sharing this with us now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.62,0:05:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not tell us sooner?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.88,0:05:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not try to live longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.82,0:05:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's a curse, Principal Gakuganji.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.76,0:05:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a curse that is\Nhanded down from me to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.82,0:05:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Masamichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you fight me I assume you\Nhate me enough to kill me pandas
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,aren't bound by things like that\Nbesides you were never on bad terms with
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.82,0:06:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Masamichi to me you're just the\Nrandom knife that happened to fall
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.20,0:06:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,upon him but still just make sure
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.64,0:06:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you remember this even pandas can cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.62,0:06:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.90,0:06:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.02,0:07:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otona Shoko ha nahe nahe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.90,0:07:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.94,0:07:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuroi sa bakarete.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.32,0:07:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.28,0:07:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sampo ukaute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.78,0:07:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.02,0:07:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aizzo mabirete.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.40,0:07:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.48,0:07:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kako u tsulibaste. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.44,0:07:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aizzo Aizzo take out tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.74,0:07:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Psycho joy. Yo ii tsudette.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.24,0:07:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Da ma shi da ma shi de ii no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.74,0:07:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Da i Show nante ki mi shi nae yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.34,0:07:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aizzo Aizzo ni mo Code.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.80,0:07:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yai ko Aizzo fu ni Mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.28,0:07:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bambas wando yoreshwaiyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.88,0:07:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saraba Nitta. Haimashou.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are probably curse users\Namong the participants as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.46,0:08:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so above all, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.06,0:08:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are we changing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.46,0:08:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hakari was expelled for\Nclashing with the Upper Brass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.30,0:08:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's also actively violating\NJujutsu regulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.58,0:08:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he finds out with\NJujutsu High, he might run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.64,0:08:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like we're cops and he's the robber.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.32,0:08:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.23,0:08:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're on Jujutsu High's side now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.30,0:08:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in a gray zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.96,0:08:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in Hikari's eyes, at least, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.80,0:08:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he even likely to cooperate with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.16,0:08:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.22,0:08:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While our teachers say\Nhe's a good-for-nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Okkotsu claimed\Nhe's stronger than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll definitely want his strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.50,0:08:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You brats better get on home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.48,0:08:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no place for you\Nguys to be hanging out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.90,0:09:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have until the count\Nof three to turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.48,0:09:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, I start swinging my fists.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.16,0:09:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.62,0:09:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's join your little fight\Nclub so we can earn some.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.46,0:09:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first rule of our Fight Club is that\Nyou do not talk about our Fight Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.48,0:09:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who blabbed, and where can I find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.90,0:09:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I like what you say,\NI won't beat you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.18,0:09:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never learned his\Nname, and I killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.48,0:09:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was about a month ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.20,0:09:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just some scumbag who was all talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kento disappeared about a month ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.34,0:09:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can take his slot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.50,0:09:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or if you prefer, I can just beat\Nyou to a pulp in front of your boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.72,0:09:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.96,0:09:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd be wary if we\Nsuddenly asked to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.78,0:09:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we shouldn't know\Nhis name's Hakari, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.88,0:09:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, there's no proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.79,0:09:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to zip the lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.78,0:09:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.86,0:09:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.02,0:09:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boss has given you the go-ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.68,0:09:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lucky—one of our\Nfighters just dropped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.62,0:09:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One thing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.62,0:09:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friend's the one who's fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.60,0:10:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.30,0:10:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think Dori's better suited\Nfor this kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.62,0:10:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No chance. I fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.10,0:10:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boss said he doesn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you don't like\Nit, then the deal's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.90,0:10:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, he'll fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.66,0:10:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fushiguro, that was risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.12,0:10:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your bluffs go too far sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.44,0:10:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You worry too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.16,0:10:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If curse users are participating\Nin the fight club too,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.06,0:10:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that means there must be decent turnover.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.10,0:10:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The curse users are here all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.62,0:10:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he was watching us\Nthrough security cameras,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.44,0:10:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then there's a high chance\NAkari is in there as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.20,0:10:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You snoop around from the inside, Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.66,0:10:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, I'm going to\Ncheck out that parking lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.98,0:10:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe. Maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.68,0:10:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's ignoring me for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.56,0:10:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Ikari learns we're trying\Nto infiltrate his club,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.06,0:10:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll lose his trust in our\Nopportunity to make contact with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.36,0:10:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we'll just resort\Nto force if that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.60,0:10:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That really should be our last resort.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.26,0:10:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here for one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.82,0:11:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To ask Ikari for his\Ncooperation in joining us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.86,0:11:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to avoid harming\Nany future alliances.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.66,0:11:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I don't think I\Nshould be doing anything tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.82,0:11:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't want to waste\Nthe time we do have until
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.06,0:11:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tsumiki is forced to\Nparticipate in the Cullen game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.66,0:11:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, it's 5 p .m. on the 10th.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.00,0:11:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So nine days until the deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.96,0:11:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it took us longer to get here\Nthan we originally thought it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.80,0:11:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I'll be looking\Nfor Hakari tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.26,0:11:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if it looks too risky, I'll pull out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.90,0:11:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I said maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.76,0:11:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.30,0:11:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there are only two rules\Nno running away and no
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.90,0:11:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,using curse techniques\Nhow come i don't mind if
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.76,0:11:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're using curse\Ntechniques they won't help
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.72,0:11:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them because most of the\Ncrowd are non-sorcerers
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.18,0:11:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and can't see them a\Nfight no one can see sucks
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.84,0:11:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the no running rule\Nit means you fight where
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the spectators can see\Nyou it's all about the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.58,0:11:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spectators huh they paid\Nto get in business 101
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.90,0:12:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's the boss like?\NCurious, huh? Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.64,0:12:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll know if you meet\Nhim if or when there are
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.22,0:12:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,two kinds of matches real\Nbeatdowns like today's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.22,0:12:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tournament and fixed\Nbounce the boss writes
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.20,0:12:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the script for those he\Nmight call for you if you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.42,0:12:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,manage to shine out there\Nyou're saying to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.80,0:12:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the boss i just need to\Nput on a good show you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.46,0:12:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really can't make things\Nmuch simpler than that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.74,0:12:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there. That's your\Nopponent for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was blown away the\Nfirst time I saw him too
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.50,0:12:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.98,0:12:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really is all about\Ndrawing in the crowd
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.98,0:12:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to get it started?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.10,0:12:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it's time for the\NKachinko Fight Club Tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.50,0:13:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello everybody, I'm your commentator\Nfor the night, John Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.58,0:13:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce\Ntonight's exciting matchup.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.10,0:13:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're joined by a sudden upstart!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.22,0:13:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will he rise up or burn out?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.58,0:13:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the dangerous\Nfireball kid, Yuji Itadori!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.06,0:13:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please welcome Panda!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.16,0:13:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, take your bets!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.38,0:13:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slice your bets!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.62,0:13:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone ready to rumble!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.76,0:13:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel my passion draining away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.50,0:13:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, my sweet baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.60,0:13:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If one is lucky, then\Nhe's meant to be tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.90,0:13:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's boring to gamble when you\Nknow who will win from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There aren't many stray sorcerers\Nwho are tough enough to beat Panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.30,0:13:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you might be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.42,0:13:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.90,0:13:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Panda, have you seen Hakari yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.06,0:13:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.44,0:14:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not suspicious of me because we\Nknow each other, but he's avoiding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.06,0:14:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, the other third year's\Ntechnique is also going to be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.40,0:14:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're hiding the fact\Nthat you're from Jujutsu High.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.76,0:14:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.18,0:14:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what to do now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.78,0:14:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is definitely the best bout\Nin my career as a commentator!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.86,0:14:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I have only been\None for the last two weeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.40,0:14:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.44,0:15:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The winner, Itadori!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.18,0:15:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.09,0:15:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That punch was a foul!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.76,0:15:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.16,0:15:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna call the SPCA on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.26,0:15:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your acting sucks. Send E.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.48,0:15:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Todori up to the roof after\Nhe wins the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.24,0:15:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.15,0:15:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's sure to win it. Plus,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.70,0:15:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's intentionally fighting\Nin three dimensions
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.86,0:15:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to wow the spectators\Nin the upper rafters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.42,0:15:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can write a good script with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.60,0:15:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And like I always say...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.34,0:15:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to strike while the iron is hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.82,0:15:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've asked you to use a\Ncoaster a hundred times.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.32,0:15:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.23,0:15:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what about his buddy, the\Nother brat who didn't fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.10,0:15:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Continue to keep a close eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.18,0:15:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll send Kirara later as backup. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.32,0:15:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling a buzz right now that\NI haven't felt in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.46,0:16:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't felt this alive since\Nmy ex maxed out my credit cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.30,0:16:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've asked you a million\Ntimes not to mention your ex.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.48,0:16:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things are looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.00,0:16:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be too long before\NItadori and Hakari meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.24,0:16:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Panda, why haven't you\Nbeen able to see Hakari yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.54,0:16:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.45,0:16:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I do know where he likes to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.26,0:16:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the monitor room on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.46,0:16:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I haven't been able\Nto get close enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.62,0:16:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.88,0:16:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even when I approach the door, I\Ncan't seem to close the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.30,0:16:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sensation feels similar\Nto Satoru's technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's probably due to Kirara's technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.54,0:16:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirara?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.45,0:16:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I thought the other\Nthird-year student is a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.94,0:16:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.86,0:16:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this, does that phenomenon only occur\Nwhen Kira-ra's in the monitor room?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.72,0:16:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been focusing too much\Non being a circus panda
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.48,0:16:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,instead of pushing more\Nand making them run off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.86,0:16:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just really glad the\Ntwo of you showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.44,0:16:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think Itadori has\Na chance to persuade him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.16,0:17:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be tough, but it's just a\Nmatter of time before he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.18,0:17:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think Itadori's light,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.60,0:17:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,charming personality is a good\Nmatch for someone like Hakari.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.60,0:17:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you won't believe\Nhow bad his acting sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.10,0:17:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't just suck at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.24,0:17:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He struggles to even\Nsee lying as an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.40,0:17:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that explains it, but it didn't stop\Nhim from talking trash about my acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.96,0:17:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.87,0:17:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,once Itadori enters the monitor room,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.64,0:17:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll buy him time by taking\Ncontrol of the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.38,0:17:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.76,0:17:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.92,0:17:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know where all the cameras\Nand their blind spots are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.56,0:17:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many guards are in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.34,0:17:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four at the entrance, and two on\Neach floor except for up on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.38,0:17:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, we can handle that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only real concern\Nis Kirana's technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.56,0:17:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't do anything about that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.42,0:17:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they can warp Itadori out\Nof there, or warp in backup,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.98,0:17:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll give up on pursuing Hakari.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.18,0:17:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you look so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.88,0:17:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you still a first-year Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.10,0:17:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.01,0:17:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken had to repeat a year in middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.58,0:18:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you have a happy life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.62,0:18:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.88,0:18:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since Ken's gotten\Nall heated up like this, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.40,0:18:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, I simply love it\Nwhen Kin is passionate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.96,0:18:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mitsudori,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.87,0:18:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would you believe me if I said\Nyou can earn a million yen a
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.48,0:18:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,month by doing something that\Ntakes only an hour a day to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.68,0:18:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it depends\Non what that something is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.78,0:18:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you'll have to pay me 200,000 yen to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.56,0:18:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,buy the information on what\Nthat something is. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.58,0:18:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.58,0:18:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, because just like you suspected,\NI was presenting you with a classic con.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.34,0:18:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The swindler pretends to be rich,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.30,0:18:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,selling the means to be rich to those\Ndesperate to be rich in a classic scam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.08,0:18:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's obvious if you\Nthink about it logically,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.44,0:18:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's a huge number\Nof fools who fall for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.32,0:18:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.60,0:18:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it all has to do with passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.48,0:18:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Passion?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.39,0:19:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both swindler and swindled\Nhave the same passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.26,0:19:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They both have a compulsive drive to\Nchange their lives for the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.74,0:19:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People high on passion lose\Nsight of their judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.02,0:19:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet without passion, no one in\Nthe world would ever fall in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.88,0:19:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love that obsessive passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.06,0:19:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know the most direct\Nway people deal with passion?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.14,0:19:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gambling?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.20,0:19:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First time I saw you, I\Nknew you would get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.64,0:19:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, life is a gamble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.90,0:19:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you the number of women that\Nhave dumped me because they hate gambling,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.74,0:19:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I think they're the ones\Nwho've got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.70,0:19:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our society throws out\Nthose who can't bet big,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.64,0:19:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as well as those who don't know when to\Nfold their hands and call it a night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.02,0:19:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't a single person\Nalive who doesn't gamble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.48,0:19:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What people hate isn't the gambling, it's\Nthe losing and the being ruined forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.08,0:19:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be some people who\Njust want to live a peaceful life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.70,0:19:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not anyone that I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.26,0:20:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the people that I know\Nlove passion above all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.86,0:20:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Passion equals gambling,\Nand gambling equals life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.72,0:20:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And love equals control.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.20,0:20:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I want to control this nation's\Npassion through my fight club one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.30,0:20:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the existence of curses going public\Nand headquarters barely able to function,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.02,0:20:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is my chance to expand the business.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.54,0:20:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to crush the opposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll make them publicly\Nrecognize my fight club
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.74,0:20:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the coming revisions to\Nthe Jujutsu regulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.94,0:20:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to do that, I'll need\Na strong player on my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.82,0:20:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itadori, how do you feel about\Ngetting high on my passion?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.92,0:20:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, boss, I need to tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.44,0:20:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I haven't offered you a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm good with anything,\Nreally, other than liquor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.24,0:21:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.15,0:21:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't handle it or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.52,0:21:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's just I'm still underage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.30,0:21:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't strike me as the\Ntype to care about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.86,0:21:13.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know Gojo can't\Nhold his liquor either?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.90,0:21:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, who's Gojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.12,0:21:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I never said that I\Ncan't, just that I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.88,0:21:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why the act? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.42,0:21:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't a single sorcerer\Nwho hasn't heard of Satoru Gojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.32,0:21:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why did you feign ignorance? Or you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.88,0:21:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sent by Jujutsu High.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.62,0:21:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,L-listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.00,0:21:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.36,0:22:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I get a call from Kirara's phone,\Nit's a signal something's fishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.00,0:22:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.98,0:22:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save it, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.20,0:22:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My passion has gone cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.26,0:23:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.46,0:23:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid. I'm afraid. I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.88,0:23:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.66,0:23:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'm looking forward\Nto. Looking forward to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.90,0:23:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.02,0:23:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,circle

